  "notes": "Website design system derived from BrandKit Lab strale-reference-kit-06 (9 September 2026), chosen by the founder as the visual direction on 23 October 2026. The eleven kit colours (brand.* except brand.image-ground, which is sampled from the kit artwork), the font families, the type roles hero, campaign, section, detail, body, compact and label, the 8px control radius and the reveal durations are carried over from the kit unchanged. The dark theme, interaction/status/code/chart colours, the extra type roles (subhead, lead, ui, small, code, stat), spacing, elevation, grid and motion easing are derived here and are not in the kit. Palette keys: brand.* are theme-independent; light.* and dark.* are role colours that resolve to the same CSS custom property per theme; chart.light.* and chart.dark.* are the categorical chart slots, in fixed order. Human guide: design/brand-kit/open-flow/README.md. Contrast proof is generated from layout.contrast by design/brand-kit/open-flow/build.mjs into CONTRAST.md. Adopted by DEC-20261024-B on 2026-10-24. Revised to 0.2 (Daylight) by DEC-20261025-A on 2026-10-25: the light canvas is white, the light tinted surfaces are paler and cooler, and the kit's no-loop rule is narrowed to ambient-only (the home Switchboard hero and the pulsing status dots). The kit colours, type, spacing and dark theme are unchanged. These values are the website surface in design/tokens/active.json, and design:check fails if the two differ. Revised to 0.3 on 2026-10-26 under Petter's direction of that day (\"some of the fonts … especially for ordinary text, should be slightly smaller … revisit our entire font sizing framework\"; relayed in session): running text is one step smaller (body 16→17px instead of 16→19px, lead 17→19px, compact 16px, detail 16→18px, small 13→14px); the kit's 16px floor for body and compact reading text is kept; headings, label, code and UI sizes are unchanged. 0.3 also adds the Switchboard circuit roles (circuit, circuit-grid) so the hero's connector lines stand clear of the board grid, a contrast pair for the connector lines, and layout.viewport.height (the small viewport height the home hero fills). In the same revision, from a measured comparison with a site Petter thinks resizes well: measures are set from a target line length (body 45ch, compact 46ch, lead 44ch, about 70 characters a line; the kit's 62ch ran to about 95), section rhythm is 64 / 80 / 96px (was 64 / 96 / 128), and the content container steps up to 1320px at 1600px and 1440px at 1920px (breakpoints 2xl and 3xl, layout.container_steps). Revised kit roles are tagged derived and keep the kit's values in kit_original. Everything else is unchanged from 0.2.",
